{"how-to-learn-piano-by-yourself-10-step-roadmap": [740, "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Schibsted+Grotesk:wght@500;700;800&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,500;1,500&family=Noto+Music&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{width:1200px;height:740px;font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;background:#f3f6f7;color:#15191c;padding:52px 60px 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.eyebrow{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2e6475}\nh1{font-size:48px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:8px 0 26px}\n.foot{position:absolute;left:60px;right:60px;bottom:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:17px;color:#56666e;font-weight:500}\n.foot b{letter-spacing:.12em;color:#2e6475}\n.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9e2e5;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgb(21 25 28/6%),0 8px 24px rgb(21 25 28/6%)}\nsvg text{font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.mus{font-family:\"Noto Music\",serif}\n</style></head><body><div class=\"eyebrow\">Teach yourself piano</div><h1>How to play piano in 10 steps</h1><svg width=\"1080\" height=\"440\" viewBox=\"0 0 1080 440\"><polyline points=\"100.0,75.0 320.0,75.0 540.0,75.0 760.0,75.0 980.0,75.0 980.0,325.0 760.0,325.0 540.0,325.0 320.0,325.0 100.0,325.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f6b31e\" stroke-width=\"8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M980.0,75.0 C1140,75.0 1140,325.0 980.0,325.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f6b31e\" stroke-width=\"8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d9e2e5\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"36\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#2e6475\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"44\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\">1</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#15191c\">Pick your goal</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#56666e\">Songs, reading or ear</text><rect x=\"220\" y=\"0\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d9e2e5\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"254\" cy=\"36\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#2e6475\"/><text x=\"254\" y=\"44\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\">2</text><text x=\"238\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#15191c\">Get a keyboard</text><text x=\"238\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#56666e\">88 weighted keys</text><rect x=\"440\" y=\"0\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d9e2e5\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"474\" cy=\"36\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#2e6475\"/><text x=\"474\" y=\"44\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\">3</text><text x=\"458\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#15191c\">Set up a space</text><text x=\"458\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#56666e\">Piano out, ready to go</text><rect x=\"660\" y=\"0\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d9e2e5\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"694\" cy=\"36\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#2e6475\"/><text x=\"694\" y=\"44\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\">4</text><text x=\"678\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#15191c\">Learn the keys</text><text x=\"678\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#56666e\">C D E F G A B</text><rect x=\"880\" y=\"0\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d9e2e5\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"914\" cy=\"36\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#2e6475\"/><text x=\"914\" y=\"44\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\">5</text><text x=\"898\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#15191c\">Sit and shape</text><text x=\"898\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#56666e\">Posture and fingers</text><rect x=\"880\" y=\"250\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d9e2e5\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"914\" cy=\"286\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#2e6475\"/><text x=\"914\" y=\"294\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\">6</text><text x=\"898\" y=\"344\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#15191c\">Play a melody</text><text x=\"898\" y=\"374\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#56666e\">C position, one hand</text><rect x=\"660\" y=\"250\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d9e2e5\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"694\" cy=\"286\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#2e6475\"/><text x=\"694\" y=\"294\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\">7</text><text x=\"678\" y=\"344\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#15191c\">Feel the beat</text><text x=\"678\" y=\"374\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#56666e\">Count with a click</text><rect x=\"440\" y=\"250\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d9e2e5\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"474\" cy=\"286\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#2e6475\"/><text x=\"474\" y=\"294\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\">8</text><text x=\"458\" y=\"344\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#15191c\">Read music</text><text x=\"458\" y=\"374\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#56666e\">Five minutes a day</text><rect x=\"220\" y=\"250\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d9e2e5\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"254\" cy=\"286\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#2e6475\"/><text x=\"254\" y=\"294\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\">9</text><text x=\"238\" y=\"344\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#15191c\">Play chords</text><text x=\"238\" y=\"374\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#56666e\">C, G, Am, F</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"250\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#15191c\" stroke=\"#d9e2e5\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"286\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#f6b31e\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"294\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#15191c\">10</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"344\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\">Hands together</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"374\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#c9d4d8\">One level at a time</text></svg><div style=\"margin-top:6px;display:flex;justify-content:center\"><div style=\"background:#f6b31e;color:#1b1400;font-weight:800;font-size:24px;padding:12px 26px;border-radius:99px\">Finish line: play the songs you love</div></div><div class=\"foot\"><span>Pianoers.com \u00b7 Teach yourself piano</span><b>PIANOERS.COM</b></div></body></html>"], "learning-piano-myths-vs-facts": [910, "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Schibsted+Grotesk:wght@500;700;800&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,500;1,500&family=Noto+Music&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{width:1200px;height:910px;font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;background:#f3f6f7;color:#15191c;padding:52px 60px 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.eyebrow{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2e6475}\nh1{font-size:48px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:8px 0 26px}\n.foot{position:absolute;left:60px;right:60px;bottom:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:17px;color:#56666e;font-weight:500}\n.foot b{letter-spacing:.12em;color:#2e6475}\n.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9e2e5;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgb(21 25 28/6%),0 8px 24px rgb(21 25 28/6%)}\nsvg text{font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.mus{font-family:\"Noto Music\",serif}\n</style></head><body><div class=\"eyebrow\">Myths vs facts</div><h1>Six piano myths that stop beginners</h1><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px\"><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\"><span style=\"background:#fbe4dd;color:#b0442d;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px\">MYTH</span><span style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#7a8a91;text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-thickness:2px\">I'm too old to learn piano.</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><span style=\"flex:none;background:#dcefe5;color:#1f7a4d;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:3px\">FACT</span><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.42\">Adults aged 60 to 85 with no musical background took six months of piano lessons and improved on attention and working-memory tests.</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#56666e;margin-left:68px\">Bugos et al., Aging &amp; Mental Health, 2007</div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\"><span style=\"background:#fbe4dd;color:#b0442d;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px\">MYTH</span><span style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#7a8a91;text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-thickness:2px\">You need 10,000 hours.</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><span style=\"flex:none;background:#dcefe5;color:#1f7a4d;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:3px\">FACT</span><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.42\">10,000 hours was the average practice of top violin students at an elite music academy by age 20: future soloists, not hobbyists.</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#56666e;margin-left:68px\">Ericsson, Krampe &amp; Tesch-R\u00f6mer, 1993</div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\"><span style=\"background:#fbe4dd;color:#b0442d;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px\">MYTH</span><span style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#7a8a91;text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-thickness:2px\">More hours means more progress.</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><span style=\"flex:none;background:#dcefe5;color:#1f7a4d;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:3px\">FACT</span><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.42\">Among 17 advanced pianists, how long they practised didn't predict who played best. How they practised did.</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#56666e;margin-left:68px\">Duke, Simmons &amp; Cash, 2009</div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\"><span style=\"background:#fbe4dd;color:#b0442d;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px\">MYTH</span><span style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#7a8a91;text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-thickness:2px\">You need an acoustic piano to start.</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><span style=\"flex:none;background:#dcefe5;color:#1f7a4d;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:3px\">FACT</span><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.42\">A digital piano with 88 weighted, touch-sensitive keys is a fine first instrument, and it never needs tuning.</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#56666e;margin-left:68px\">Pianoers buying guides</div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\"><span style=\"background:#fbe4dd;color:#b0442d;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px\">MYTH</span><span style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#7a8a91;text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-thickness:2px\">An app can teach you everything.</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><span style=\"flex:none;background:#dcefe5;color:#1f7a4d;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:3px\">FACT</span><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.42\">Apps hear your notes and timing. They can't see your wrists or fingers, so film your hands once a month.</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#56666e;margin-left:68px\">Pianoers teaching advice</div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\"><span style=\"background:#fbe4dd;color:#b0442d;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px\">MYTH</span><span style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#7a8a91;text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-thickness:2px\">You must read music before playing songs.</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><span style=\"flex:none;background:#dcefe5;color:#1f7a4d;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:3px\">FACT</span><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.42\">Many players start with chords and play real songs in weeks. Reading opens more music, so add it a few minutes a day.</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#56666e;margin-left:68px\">Pianoers teaching advice</div></div></div><div class=\"foot\"><span>Pianoers.com \u00b7 Teach yourself piano</span><b>PIANOERS.COM</b></div></body></html>"], "science-of-learning-piano-statistics": [870, "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Schibsted+Grotesk:wght@500;700;800&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,500;1,500&family=Noto+Music&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{width:1200px;height:870px;font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;background:#f3f6f7;color:#15191c;padding:52px 60px 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.eyebrow{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2e6475}\nh1{font-size:48px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:8px 0 26px}\n.foot{position:absolute;left:60px;right:60px;bottom:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:17px;color:#56666e;font-weight:500}\n.foot b{letter-spacing:.12em;color:#2e6475}\n.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9e2e5;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgb(21 25 28/6%),0 8px 24px rgb(21 25 28/6%)}\nsvg text{font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.mus{font-family:\"Noto Music\",serif}\n</style></head><body><div class=\"eyebrow\">The research</div><h1>The science of teaching yourself piano</h1><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px\"><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><div style=\"font-size:84px;line-height:1;font-weight:800;color:#b86a0a;letter-spacing:-.03em\">85%</div><div style=\"font-size:23px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.4;margin-top:14px\">of Americans who don\u2019t play an instrument wish they had learned.</div><div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#56666e;margin-top:14px\">Gallup survey for NAMM, 2009</div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><div style=\"font-size:84px;line-height:1;font-weight:800;color:#2e6475;letter-spacing:-.03em\">~20%</div><div style=\"font-size:23px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.4;margin-top:14px\">faster on a practised finger sequence after a night\u2019s sleep. Twelve hours awake brought no significant gain.</div><div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#56666e;margin-top:14px\">Walker et al., Neuron, 2002</div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><div style=\"font-size:84px;line-height:1;font-weight:800;color:#2e6475;letter-spacing:-.03em\">17</div><div style=\"font-size:23px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.4;margin-top:14px\">advanced pianists were studied: <b>how</b> they practised, not how long, predicted who played best.</div><div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#56666e;margin-top:14px\">Duke, Simmons &amp; Cash, J. of Research in Music Education, 2009</div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:26px 28px\"><div style=\"font-size:84px;line-height:1;font-weight:800;color:#b86a0a;letter-spacing:-.03em\">6 mo</div><div style=\"font-size:23px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.4;margin-top:14px\">of piano lessons improved attention and working memory in adults aged 60 to 85.</div><div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#56666e;margin-top:14px\">Bugos et al., Aging &amp; Mental Health, 2007</div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:18px;padding:16px 22px;font-size:20px;background:#fff8e6\"><b>What it means:</b> practise a little most days, fix mistakes slowly, then sleep on it.</div><div class=\"foot\"><span>Pianoers.com \u00b7 Teach yourself piano</span><b>PIANOERS.COM</b></div></body></html>"], "how-to-choose-a-way-to-learn-piano-flowchart": [740, "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Schibsted+Grotesk:wght@500;700;800&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,500;1,500&family=Noto+Music&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{width:1200px;height:740px;font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;background:#f3f6f7;color:#15191c;padding:52